        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Han Chae-young, Lee Byung-hun\n- Works: Autumn in My Heart, Delightful Girl Choon-Hyang, Only You, Fireworks, Boys Over Flowers, A Man Called God, Pretty Man, The Influence\n- Organizations: KBS2\n- Topics: Korean dramas, television broadcast\n\nFacts:\n- Han Chae-young is known for notable roles in the Korean dramas \"Autumn in My Heart,\" \"Delightful Girl Choon-Hyang,\" \"Only You,\" and \"Fireworks.\"\n- \"Boys Over Flowers\" aired on KBS2 from January 5, 2009 to March 31, 2009 on Mondays and Tuesdays at 22:00 for 25 episodes.\n- Han Chae-young is also known for a notable role in the Korean drama \"Boys Over Flowers.\"\n- Han Chae-young is known for notable roles in the Korean dramas \"A Man Called God\" and \"Pretty Man.\"\n- \"The Influence\" is a four-part online film starring Lee Byung-hun and Han Chae-young.",
